translate id inttaxi_c74701b8:
    "Sopir taksi" "\" I see, it was some sausage party. I guess I can say bad luck for you.\""

translate id inttaxi_580e4893:
    mc "Ya, saya bersenang-senang dengan beberapa dari mereka."

translate id inttaxi_6f18d5b1:
    "Sopir Taksi" "\" Yeah I knew it, this european girls are really naughty ones.\""

translate id inttaxi_3084647c:
    "Sopir Taksi" "\" What's certain is that I really need to go there. Maybe in The Netherlands or better yet, in France.\""

translate id inttaxi_3a4ed966:
    "Sopir Taksi" "\"The french girls seem to be worth the trip.\""

